      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 21,
      "SpeakerName": "讲师",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "『失恋』这个设定，是卡特莉娜小姐自己追加的吧。/n为什么选择了这种情境？",
      "VoiceFileName": "20031030210",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2003103023,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2003103,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 22,
      "SpeakerName": "卡特莉娜",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "那个……所谓普通女孩，每个人对『普通』的定义都不同，/n而人生本身又是各种事情不断累积起来的。",
      "VoiceFileName": "20031030220",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 100,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 11,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 1,
          "SpineId": 10303,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "103"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2003103024,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2003103,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 23,
      "SpeakerName": "卡特莉娜",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "有悲伤的事，也有开心的事，/n而在这样的日常里，某一天忽然下起了雨。",
      "VoiceFileName": "20031030230",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 107,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 7,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 4,
          "SpineId": 0,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "103"
    },
    {
